{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu20", "cards": [{"id": "u1.t.dichotomous-key", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">di<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">CHOT<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">mous<\/span> <span class=\"st\">KEY<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"dichotomous key\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: dichotomous key\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"dichotomous key\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"60\" y=\"6\" width=\"80\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f6\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"21\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Has wings?<\/text><line x1=\"85\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"45\" y2=\"56\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"115\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"155\" y2=\"56\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">yes<\/text><text x=\"144\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">no<\/text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"58\" width=\"80\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Go to step 2<\/text><rect x=\"112\" y=\"58\" width=\"80\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"152\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Go to step 3<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">two choices every step<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A tool for identifying an organism by choosing between two descriptions at each step.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>二歧检索表<\/b>：通过每一步在两个描述中二选一来鉴定生物的工具。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">dicho- = in two, tomos = cut. Cut in two each time.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">dicho- = 分成两半，tomos = 切：每一步一分为二。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: How many choices does a dichotomous key give at each step?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Two.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.phylogeny", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">phy<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">LOG<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">e<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ny<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"phylogeny\" data-audio=\"audio/phylogeny.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: phylogeny\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"phylogeny\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"56.875\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"10\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"13\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">lamprey<\/text><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"56.875\" x2=\"36\" y2=\"56.875\"/><line x1=\"36\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"36\" y2=\"78.75\"/><line x1=\"36\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"35\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">trout<\/text><line x1=\"36\" y1=\"78.75\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"78.75\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"97.5\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"60\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">frog<\/text><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"97.5\" x2=\"92\" y2=\"97.5\"/><line x1=\"92\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"92\" y2=\"110\"/><line x1=\"92\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"85\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">lizard<\/text><line x1=\"92\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"110\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"113\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">mouse<\/text><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"33.4375\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"33.4375\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The evolutionary history of a species or group, and how related it is to others.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>系统发生<\/b>：一个物种或类群的演化历史，以及它与其他类群的亲缘关系。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">phylo- = tribe, -geny = origin. Family-tree origin.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">phylo- = 族，-geny = 起源：族谱式的起源。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What does a phylogeny show?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">How species are related through evolution.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.cladogram", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">CLAD<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gram<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"cladogram\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: cladogram\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"cladogram\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"26.6667\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"93.3333\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"26.6667\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"26.6667\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"43.3333\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"10\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"13\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">lion<\/text><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"43.3333\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"43.3333\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"46.3333\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">tiger<\/text><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"93.3333\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"93.3333\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"76.6667\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"110\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"76.6667\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"76.6667\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"79.6667\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">wolf<\/text><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"110\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"113\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">fox<\/text><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"60\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A branching diagram that shows how groups of organisms are related through shared traits.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>分支图<\/b>：用共有性状表示生物类群亲缘关系的分支图。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">clado- = branch, -gram = picture. A branch picture.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">clado- = 分支，-gram = 图。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: On a cladogram, which two species are most closely related?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The two that share the most recent common ancestor (the nearest branch point).<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.clade", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">CLADE<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"clade\" data-audio=\"audio/clade.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: clade\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"clade\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"62\" y=\"66\" width=\"118\" height=\"46\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f5 d\"/><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"60\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"38\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"90\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"38\" x2=\"118\" y2=\"38\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"123\" y=\"41\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">frog<\/text><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"90\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"102\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"118\" y2=\"80\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"123\" y=\"83\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">lizard<\/text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"118\" y2=\"102\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"123\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">mouse<\/text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"91\" r=\"3\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">clade<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A group made of one ancestor and all of its descendants.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>进化枝<\/b>：由一个祖先及其所有后代组成的类群。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A clade is a whole branch cut at one point: ancestor and every descendant.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">进化枝 = 从一个节点剪下的整根树枝：祖先加全部后代。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Does a clade include the common ancestor and all descendants?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Yes. It includes both.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.common-ancestor", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">COM<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">mon<\/span> <span class=\"st\">AN<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ces<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tor<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"common ancestor\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: common ancestor\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"common ancestor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"60\" r=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"8\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">common ancestor<\/text><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"30\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"90\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"33\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">species A<\/text><text x=\"65\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">species B<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The species that two or more groups both descended from.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>共同祖先<\/b>：两个或多个类群共同由其演化而来的物种。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Ancestor = the one before. Common = shared.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">ancestor = 在前面的那个；common = 共有。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: On a cladogram, where is the common ancestor?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">At the branch point.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.derived-characteristic", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">de<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">RIVED<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">char<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ac<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ter<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">IS<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tic<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"derived characteristic\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: derived characteristic\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"derived characteristic\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"62\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"92\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"32\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"92\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"78\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"78\" y2=\"40\" class=\"k\"/><text x=\"78\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">feathers appear<\/text><text x=\"125\" y=\"35\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">bird<\/text><text x=\"125\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">lizard<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A new trait that appears in a group and is passed on to its descendants.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>衍生特征<\/b>：在某个类群中新出现并传给后代的性状。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Derived = &quot;derived from&quot; the ancestor: a new feature added later.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">derived = 后来新增的特征。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Feathers appear only in the bird branch. What do we call feathers?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">A derived characteristic.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.six-kingdom-system", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">six-KING<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">dom<\/span> <span class=\"st\">SYS<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tem<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"six-kingdom system\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: six-kingdom system\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"six-kingdom system\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"12\" width=\"54.6667\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"33.3333\" y=\"31.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Archaea<\/text><rect x=\"72.6667\" y=\"12\" width=\"54.6667\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"31.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Bacteria<\/text><rect x=\"139.333\" y=\"12\" width=\"54.6667\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"166.667\" y=\"31.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Protista<\/text><rect x=\"139.333\" y=\"72\" width=\"54.6667\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f4\"/><text x=\"166.667\" y=\"91.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Fungi<\/text><rect x=\"72.6667\" y=\"72\" width=\"54.6667\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f5\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"91.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Plantae<\/text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"72\" width=\"54.6667\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f6\"/><text x=\"33.3333\" y=\"91.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Animalia<\/text><line x1=\"61.666666666666664\" y1=\"29.0\" x2=\"71.66666666666666\" y2=\"29.0\"/><polygon points=\"71.66666666666666,29.0 67.2,31.2 67.2,26.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><line x1=\"128.33333333333331\" y1=\"29.0\" x2=\"138.33333333333331\" y2=\"29.0\"/><polygon points=\"138.33333333333331,29.0 133.8,31.2 133.8,26.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><line x1=\"166.66666666666666\" y1=\"47\" x2=\"166.66666666666666\" y2=\"71\"/><polygon points=\"166.66666666666666,71 164.5,66.5 168.8,66.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><line x1=\"138.33333333333331\" y1=\"89.0\" x2=\"128.33333333333331\" y2=\"89.0\"/><polygon points=\"128.33333333333331,89.0 132.8,86.8 132.8,91.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><line x1=\"71.66666666666666\" y1=\"89.0\" x2=\"61.666666666666664\" y2=\"89.0\"/><polygon points=\"61.666666666666664,89.0 66.2,86.8 66.2,91.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A classification that groups life into six kingdoms: Archaea, Bacteria, Protista, Fungi, Plantae and Animalia.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>六界系统<\/b>：把生物分为六界：古菌界、细菌界、原生生物界、真菌界、植物界、动物界。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Six kingdoms: A B P F P A.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">六界首字母：A B P F P A。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which two kingdoms are prokaryotes?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Archaea and Bacteria.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.three-domain-system", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">three-do<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">MAIN<\/span> <span class=\"st\">SYS<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tem<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"three-domain system\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: three-domain system\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"three-domain system\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"85\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"10\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"13\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Bacteria<\/text><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"85\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"110\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"60\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Archaea<\/text><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"110\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"113\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Eukarya<\/text><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"47.5\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"47.5\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A classification that places all life into three domains: Bacteria, Archaea and Eukarya.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>三域系统<\/b>：把所有生物分为三个域：细菌域、古菌域和真核域。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Three big boxes: B, A, E.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">三个大盒子：B、A、E。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which domain contains the kingdom Animalia?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Eukarya.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u1.t.dichotomous-key", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A tool for identifying an organism by choosing between two descriptions at each step.”<\/i>", "opts": ["binomial nomenclature", "kingdom", "Eukarya", "dichotomous key"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>dichotomous key<\/b>: A tool for identifying an organism by choosing between two descriptions at each step. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">二歧检索表<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.phylogeny", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The evolutionary history of a species or group, and how related it is to others.”<\/i>", "opts": ["unicellular", "phylogeny", "response", "tissue"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>phylogeny<\/b>: The evolutionary history of a species or group, and how related it is to others. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">系统发生<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.cladogram", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A branching diagram that shows how groups of organisms are related through shared traits.”<\/i>", "opts": ["Eukarya", "cladogram", "phylum", "cell"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>cladogram<\/b>: A branching diagram that shows how groups of organisms are related through shared traits. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">分支图<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.clade", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A group made of one ancestor and all of its descendants.”<\/i>", "opts": ["clade", "response", "order", "prokaryote"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>clade<\/b>: A group made of one ancestor and all of its descendants. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">进化枝<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.common-ancestor", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The species that two or more groups both descended from.”<\/i>", "opts": ["ecosystem", "dichotomous key", "eukaryote", "common ancestor"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>common ancestor<\/b>: The species that two or more groups both descended from. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">共同祖先<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.derived-characteristic", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A new trait that appears in a group and is passed on to its descendants.”<\/i>", "opts": ["community", "Archaea", "response", "derived characteristic"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>derived characteristic<\/b>: A new trait that appears in a group and is passed on to its descendants. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">衍生特征<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.six-kingdom-system", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A classification that groups life into six kingdoms: Archaea, Bacteria, Protista, Fungi, Plantae and Animalia.”<\/i>", "opts": ["Eukarya", "common ancestor", "six-kingdom system", "domain"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>six-kingdom system<\/b>: A classification that groups life into six kingdoms: Archaea, Bacteria, Protista, Fungi, Plantae and Animalia. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">六界系统<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.three-domain-system", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A classification that places all life into three domains: Bacteria, Archaea and Eukarya.”<\/i>", "opts": ["species", "cell", "three-domain system", "genus"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>three-domain system<\/b>: A classification that places all life into three domains: Bacteria, Archaea and Eukarya. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">三域系统<\/span>", "whys": null}]}